xdg-desktop-portal-gtk4 is a GTK4 backend implementation for
xdg-desktop-portal. It provides portal interfaces such as file chooser,
account, app chooser, notifications, settings and more for sandboxed
applications.

The Print portal and native journald logging are Linux-only; every other
portal is available on FreeBSD.

WWW: https://github.com/JohnRTitor/xdg-desktop-portal-gtk4
